KUBERNETES CLUSTER (API Server on Port 6443)
│
├── CONTROL PLANE (The "Brain": Scheduler, Controller Manager, etcd)
│
└── WORKER NODES (The "Muscle": VMs or Physical Servers)
     │
     └── NAMESPACE (Logical grouping, e.g., "production")
          │
          └── DEPLOYMENT / STATEFULSET (Manages replicas & updates)
               │
               └── POD  <-- [SMALLEST K8S UNIT]
                    ├── Shared Cluster IP & Port (e.g., 10.244.1.5:8080)
                    ├── Shared Storage (Volumes)
                    └── CONTAINERS (The actual running apps)
                         ├── App Container (e.g., Node.js / Python API)
                         └── Sidecar Container (Optional helper, e.g., Log collector)
